          <para>A6(B) <u>write equations of quadratic functions</u> given the vertex and another point on the graph, write the equation in <u>vertex form</u> \(\underline{(f(x) = a(x - h)^2 + k)}\), and <u>rewrite the equation from vertex form to standard form \(\underline{(f(x) = ax^2 + bx + c)}\).</u></para>
        </entry>
